{"text": "NEW YORK MEDICAL COLLEGE\n\nBasie Sconce Building\nVathalla, New York 10595\n(914) 347.5700\n\nDEPARTMENT OF PATHOLOGY\n\nMay 17, 1984\n\nHr, Robert Gertenbach, President\nTne Council for Tobacco Research - U.S.A. Inc,\n110 East 59th Street\nNew York, New York 10022\n\nRe: Special Project #122\nDear tir, Gertenbach:\n\nEnclosed please find the progress report covering the period 06/01/83 ~\n05/31/84 for our research grant \"Neural factors in atherogenesis: Endothel ial\n\ninjury induced by vasospasm in the hypothalanically stimulated rac\".\n\nDuring the period indicated above, $23,000 nas been saved from our\nbudget. This sum has accrued chiefly because an additional technician was not\nhired until late ia the year, it was possible to utilize another department's\nelectronic recording equigment which will no longer be available to us and aot\nall of the supply money was used, since the electron microscopic studies had\nnot as yet been faitiated.\n\nYour penaission ts requested to carry tiis sum over into the next year\nin accord with the attached revised budget.\n\nPlease note that the total amount for the two year grant period (06/91/83\n= 05/31/85) does not exceed the original amount awarded,\n\nTnank you for your consideration.\n\nSincerely yours,\n\nWillian H, Gutstein, H.0.\n\nce: Ms. Lorraine Lasker, Director\nOffice of Research Adninistration\n\nCTR SP-FILES 023902\n\n11023920",
